<p class="body-text-style body-text-size-body-small"><span>You can also opt out at any time. If you do so, you'll stop accruing new rewards immediately, and any rewards already earned will be paid out on the next scheduled payment date. </span><a href="https://www.paypal.com/us/legalhub/paypal/cryptocurrencies-tnc" target="_self" rel="" class="html-text-renderer-link" data-pa-click="{&quot;link&quot;:&quot;Accordion-Link-Paragraph-View terms and conditions&quot;,&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;text_link_clicked&quot;}">View terms and conditions</a><span>.</span></p>
<p class="body-text-style body-text-size-body-small">If you withdraw your full PYUSD balance, you'll still receive any rewards earned up to that point on the next payment date.</p>
<p class="body-text-style body-text-size-body-small"><span>PYUSD rewards are coming to more countries.  To check if your country is included, log into your PayPal app, verify your identity, and see if PYUSD is available. </span><a href="https://www.paypal.com/legalhub/paypal/cryptocurrencies-tnc" target="_self" rel="" class="html-text-renderer-link" data-pa-click="{&quot;link&quot;:&quot;Accordion-Link-Paragraph-Terms apply&quot;,&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;text_link_clicked&quot;}">Terms apply</a><span>.</span></p>
